[0] Route
    If AP_k maximizes meas(S7(E)) for primitive normalized |E|=k,
    then meas(S7(E)) <= meas(S7(AP_k)) < cap_k for k=8..13.
    This would close the continuous seven-sector cap from HYP-2603.

