Verdict:
    New best proof target: prove the AP-frontier envelope.
    For k=8..11, show S7(E) <= S7({0,...,k-1}); for k=12,13,
    show any AP-rich tail remains below cap_k.  The remaining separate
    layer is the colored finite-denominator placement from HYP-2593/2595.
